System -> System : System
Actor -> Actor : The notary (Escribano) requests a notebook cover.
System -> System : Escribano
Actor -> Actor : Generates the official cover layout.
System -> System : System
Actor -> Actor : The notary (Escribano) proceeds to print.
System -> System : Escribano
Actor -> Actor : Enables printing or PDF export.
System -> System : System

